Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 12:46:06 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] agent: coliagent, a gated coding agent; docs: qwen36 on a
 4 GB laptop

coliagent (agent/, stdlib only): frozen permission policy (no push, no
remote, network off, protected paths), argv-only tool runner, git and
worktrees, repo index with symbols and the import/include graph, atomic
exact-match patches, validated plans, OpenAI-compatible backend for a
local coli serve, log diagnostics, test selection from changed files,
evidence-backed claims, and a self-improvement cycle that tests one
hypothesis in an isolated worktree behind regression gates and a metric,
keeps accepted work on a local branch and never merges or pushes.

docs/q36-rtx3050-engineering.md: architecture map, root causes and fixes,
planner usage, knobs, a survey of other SSD-streaming MoE projects, a
prioritized backlog and a validation protocol for the target laptop.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
